{"updated":"2026-10-29T20:01:11.834Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfFVXA5gNzG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVXA5gNzG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它把高中物理、化學、生物、地理的知識，直接做成可以操作的 3D 互動實驗。\n\n目前已經有 54 個實驗，包含光電效應、電解反應、細胞分裂、洋流與大氣環流等。\n\n最酷的是，每個實驗都是一個約 1 MB 的獨立 HTML 檔案，不需要安裝軟體，下載後直接用瀏覽器開啟，離線也能操作。\n\n而且不是單純播放動畫，還能調整實驗參數，觀察 3D 模型變化，搭配步驟引導理解原理。\n\n所以拿來做互動式教學感覺超級適合\n甚至可以把抽象的技術文件變成能親手操作的互動教材。\n\n感覺以後學習複雜知識，不一定只能看影片，直接進去實驗可能更有趣 😂","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T04:02:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFVksOk7LL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVksOk7LL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/smith…\n線上體驗：\nlab.tongjiang.app","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T04:02:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFGYhrAC28","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFGYhrAC28","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把電子書做成真的可以「翻」的書了 📖\n\n現在閱讀 PDF、EPUB，大多都是上下滑動。\n但我想要的是那種坐在書桌前，一頁一頁翻書的感覺。\n\n所以做了一個 Flipbook，還直接做了 2D 和 3D 兩個版本。\n\n📖 2D：可以拖曳頁角翻頁、切換紙張風格，還有翻頁聲。\n🕯️ 3D：用 Three.js 做出立體書房，紙張翻動時會自然彎曲，甚至能切換暖光、日光和燭光。\n\n另外還支援：\n✅ TXT / Markdown / EPUB / PDF 匯入\n✅ 紅絲帶書籤、螢光筆標記\n✅ 自動分頁、章節目錄、閱讀進度記錄\n✅ 本機解析，不需要把書籍上傳伺服器\n\n最有趣的是，3D 版的翻頁不是單純旋轉一張平面，而是讓紙張產生 S 形彎曲\n你喜歡方便的電子書，還是有翻頁儀式感的紙本書？\n\n#ThreeJS #WebDevelopment#閱讀#book#書","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:21:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFGhz7E5kW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFGhz7E5kW","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"📌 Flipbook\nmalilion.github.io/flipb…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:21:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfBDwm8kw5S","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfBDwm8kw5S","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它不是單純問 AI「這支股票能不能買」而是直接模擬一整間投資研究公司的運作流程\n\n裡面有不同職責的 AI Agents\n\n📊 基本面分析師：研究財報與公司價值\n📈 技術分析師：分析 RSI、MACD 等指標\n📰 新聞與情緒分析師：追蹤市場消息、社群討論\n⚔️ 多空研究員：針對投資觀點互相辯論\n\n🛡️ 風控與投資組合經理：評估風險並做出最終決策\n\n最酷的是，這些 Agent 不是各自給答案，而是真的會進行討論、質疑與決策！\n\n而且支援歷史回測、多種 LLM\n\n所以拿來研究 AI 多代理協作或股票分析感覺超級適合\n\n感覺以後不用自己開投資公司，就能先擁有一整組 AI 分析團隊了 😂\n\n不過它主要是研究與模擬框架，不代表 AI 判斷一定能賺錢\n#股市 #台股 #美股","timestamp":"2026-10-27T23:40:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfBDxY6k_x0","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfBDxY6k_x0","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/Tauri…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T23:40:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_1v2Ek9Hk","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De_1v2Ek9Hk","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它不只是一般的 AI 聊天機器人，而是一套完整的 AI 個人學習平台。\n\n可以匯入 PDF、文件或影片建立知識庫，讓 AI 根據教材回答問題，還能自動產生測驗、規劃學習路線、追蹤學習進度，甚至把複雜概念轉成互動式視覺化內容。\n\n最有趣的是，它整合了 RAG、多 Agent、記憶系統與個人化教學流程，而且支援 Docker 自架。\n\n所以拿來準備證照或學習新技術感覺超級適合\n\n例如把教材、技術文件和題庫匯入 DeepTutor，讓 AI 幫忙規劃每天的學習內容，針對答錯的觀念出新題，再用圖解說明整個架構。\n\n感覺可以把原本散落在各處的學習資源，直接變成一所自己的 AI 學校","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:18:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De_1vxRk-Cs","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De_1vxRk-Cs","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/HKUDS…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T12:18:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-pO-Hk_z2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De-pO-Hk_z2","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/Renhu…\n\n線上體驗：\nmetisziwei.com","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:09:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De-pOgzE-dQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/De-pOgzE-dQ","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"專案叫做 ziwei-doushu，目前 GitHub 已經有超過 8,100 Stars。\n\n它不是單純的算命網站，而是一套基於倪海廈《天紀》體系的紫微斗數排盤引擎。\n\n🔹 67.5 萬張命盤\n🔹 877 萬段解讀內容\n🔹 涵蓋事業、財運、感情等 13 個面向\n🔹 解壓後資料量達 56.6 GB\n\n而且排盤演算法使用 TypeScript 開發，程式碼採 MIT 授權，資料集也提供開放授權。\n\n所以拿來研究傳統命理的數位化感覺很適合\n\n例如用 Codex 打造一個互動式紫微斗數網站，輸入出生資料後，自動產生命盤，再串接 LLM，把複雜的星曜與宮位轉換成容易理解的互動式說明。\n\n甚至可以做成 RPG 風格的「人生角色面板」，把十二宮、星曜、四化變成遊戲化的視覺介面 😂\n\n當然，命理解讀屬於傳統文化觀點，不等於科學預測。\n\n但從工程角度來看，把傳統知識轉成演算法與結構化資料，真的蠻有意思的。","timestamp":"2026-10-27T01:09:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":4},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfFLEpAE6U9","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFLEpAE6U9","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一生必去--冰島，出發\n\n別刷脆了 跟我雲端遊冰島吧～\n（卡友的保姆級整理也太強了）","timestamp":"2026-10-29T14:00:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":34,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":3},"score":36,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T04:02:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFLGGTE7IE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFLGGTE7IE","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"四捨五入我也是去過冰島的人了\n\n原文來自➡️#國外遊記 出發去人生必去一次的冰島⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多冰島的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-29T14:01:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T04:02:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFEL97ir6J","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFEL97ir6J","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"社畜如何高效吃早餐？\n\n還沒出社會：優雅吃健康早餐、慢慢化妝再出門\n實際上班後：鬧鐘按掉三四次，最後被自己嚇醒，刷牙洗臉就衝出門\n\n有卡友吃膩了速食 麵包\n想少吃點高糖高油 卻又沒時間準備\n現在只能先泡杯沖泡飲墊肚子\n\n想多睡又想好好吃早餐 真的能兼顧嗎？ \n求大家分享『社畜也能吃的早餐』","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:00:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFEOKuilnv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFEOKuilnv","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B1：我也是鬧鐘按到最後一分鐘才起床\n早餐什麼的根本不存在 能準時打卡就偷笑了","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:01:00.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFEQIKioxy","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFEQIKioxy","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"B3：711 蒸地瓜+茶葉蛋+無糖豆漿+美式","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:01:16.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFESBwCs-u","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfFESBwCs-u","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"我都憋一個大的，只吃晚餐。\n\n原文來自➡️社畜如何高效吃早餐？⬅️\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多吃早餐的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:01:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE9RhyE89W","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfE9RhyE89W","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"朋友來探班，你會開心還是有壓力？🥲\n\n有卡友分享\n第一份打工在飲料店\n朋友常來探班\n有些還會希望她請喝飲料\n想說人家都來了\n不好意思拒絕\n但忙的時候又真的沒空招待\n\n後來換工作\n乾脆不太想讓朋友知道在哪裡上班\n\n大家能接受朋友來探班嗎？ \n還是會希望「下班再約，上班先別來」？","timestamp":"2026-10-29T12:00:18.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE9SpwkzdA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfE9SpwkzdA","username":"