鍵。透過 Feedback Loop，繼續回饋優化Harness Quality!","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":13,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":17,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE205VjZT3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE205VjZT3","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"附上兩隻超有料精華影片：\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE21ZajXFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE21ZajXFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"youtube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:04:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfFftcBgQTN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfFftcBgQTN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"OpenAI pro 方案\n額度兩倍！\n\n也就是說原本20x縮水成10x的計劃取消","timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:01:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":44,"replies":11,"reposts":2,"shares":7},"score":72,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T04:02:02+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfEGCmBkTUt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfEGCmBkTUt","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"眾銀行們\n不考慮做一下 mac studio 的貸款嗎？\n\n這拿來當抵押品應該比汽車還不錯","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:57:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":341,"replies":61,"reposts":4,"shares":171},"score":475,"first_seen":"2026-10-30T01:56:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfBhyt0EV0H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfBhyt0EV0H","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"謠傳 Gemini 4 Flash 準備出現\n不知道是不是在等這兩天的財報\n\n但能肯定的是 Google 想改走化學老師路線\n\nAgron - 氬\nCarbon - 碳\nHydrogen - 氫","timestamp":"2026-10-28T04:02:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":37,"replies":4,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":48,"first_see